{"jsonapi":{"version":"1.0","meta":{"links":{"self":{"href":"http://jsonapi.org/format/1.0/"}}}},"data":{"type":"node--event","id":"22a1eb51-ed07-45a2-9e57-e7e881c359f0","links":{"self":{"href":"https://drupal.nypl.org/jsonapi/node/event/22a1eb51-ed07-45a2-9e57-e7e881c359f0?resourceVersion=id%3A392671"},"working-copy":{"href":"https://drupal.nypl.org/jsonapi/node/event/22a1eb51-ed07-45a2-9e57-e7e881c359f0?resourceVersion=rel%3Aworking-copy"}},"attributes":{"title":"Crafty Chat! Come Knit or Crochet with Us!","path":{"alias":"/events/programs/2026/10/13/crafty-chat-come-knit-or-crochet-us","pid":233590,"langcode":"en"},"body":{"value":"<p>This is an online event.</p><p>This is a virtual fiber art circle where we chat, craft, and create! Join us as we crochet, knit, or sew and share our knowledge and WIPS. AS well as our deep love of YAAAAARRRRN! All the yarn. Nothing but yarn.</p><p>We will also do our best to give instruction on your knitting, crocheting, or sewing questions. So make sure to have your supplies and projects with you, and come craft with us!</p><p>Don't hesitate to virtually browse all of the NYPL titles. If you have any questions on how to place a physical book or digital book on hold, we can help you with that too! Or you can ask <a href=\"https://www.nypl.org/get-help/contact-us/chat\">here</a>.&nbsp;</p><blockquote><p><em><strong>You must register with your email address in order to receive the link to participate. The link will be sent to you by email before our event. You will need a device with audio and/or video and an internet connection to join.</strong></em></p></blockquote><p>Sign up for <a href=\"https://pages.email.nypl.org/nyplconnect/\">NYPL Connect</a> to get updates from NYPL and information about our digital resources and services availabl</p>","format":"text_with_video","processed":"<p>This is an online event.</p>\n<p>This is a virtual fiber art circle where we chat, craft, and create! Join us as we crochet, knit, or sew and share our knowledge and WIPS. AS well as our deep love of YAAAAARRRRN! All the yarn. Nothing but yarn.</p>\n<p>We will also do our best to give instruction on your knitting, crocheting, or sewing questions. So make sure to have your supplies and projects with you, and come craft with us!</p>\n<p>Don't hesitate to virtually browse all of the NYPL titles. If you have any questions on how to place a physical book or digital book on hold, we can help you with that too! Or you can ask <a href=\"https://www.nypl.org/get-help/contact-us/chat\">here</a>.&nbsp;</p>\n<blockquote><p><em><strong>You must register with your email address in order to receive the link to participate. The link will be sent to you by email before our event. You will need a device with audio and/or video and an internet connection to join.</strong></em></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Sign up for <a href=\"https://pages.email.nypl.org/nyplconnect/\">NYPL Connect</a> to get updates from NYPL and information about our digital resources and services availabl</p>\n","summary":""},"field_lt_event_format":"online","field_tfls_summary_description":{"value":"This is an online event. This is a virtual fiber art circle where we chat, craft, and create! Join us as we crochet, knit, or sew and share our knowledge and WIPS.","format":null,"processed":"<p>This is an online event. This is a virtual fiber art circle where we chat, craft, and create! Join us as we crochet, knit, or sew and share our knowledge and WIPS.</p>\n"},"field_ts_event_leader_name":null},"relationships":{"field_erm_event_location":{"data":[{"type":"paragraph--event_location","id":"45501d57-1b06-4a77-ab8a-b2ce9a14dd90","meta":{"target_revision_id":1434390,"drupal_internal__target_id":324003}}],"links":{"related":{"href":"https://drupal.nypl.org/jsonapi/node/event/22a1eb51-ed07-45a2-9e57-e7e881c359f0/field_erm_event_location?resourceVersion=id%3A392671"},"self":{"href":"https://drupal.nypl.org/jsonapi/node/event/22a1eb51-ed07-45a2-9e57-e7e881c359f0/relationshi